sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Browser as Browser / React
    participant OriginFilter as SameOriginStateChangeFilter
    participant Security as CsrfFilter + LogoutFilter
    participant SessionApi as SessionController
    participant Session as Server-side HTTP session

    Browser->>Security: GET /api/v1/session + vgp_session automatically
    Security->>Session: Resolve opaque session and SecurityContext
    Security->>SessionApi: Dispatch authenticated request
    SessionApi->>Session: Obtain session-bound CsrfToken
    Session-->>SessionApi: Current CSRF token
    SessionApi-->>Browser: 200 {authenticated:true, csrfToken} + Cache-Control:no-store
    Note over Browser,SessionApi: The cookie is automatic and HttpOnly, React reads only the session state

    Browser->>OriginFilter: POST /api/v1/session + Cookie automatically + X-CSRF-Token explicitly
    OriginFilter->>OriginFilter: Validate Origin and Sec-Fetch-Site when present
    alt Browser metadata rejected
        OriginFilter-->>Browser: 403 CSRF_VALIDATION_FAILED, session remains authenticated
    else Same-origin metadata accepted
        OriginFilter->>Security: Forward logout request
        Security->>Session: Resolve session and expected CSRF token
        Security->>Security: Compare X-CSRF-Token with session token
        alt Missing or invalid CSRF token
            Security-->>Browser: 403 CSRF_VALIDATION_FAILED, session remains authenticated
        else Current CSRF token
            Security->>Session: Clear SecurityContext and invalidate HTTP session
            Session-->>Security: Session invalidated
            Security-->>Browser: 204 + expire vgp_session + Cache-Control:no-store
            Browser->>Security: GET /api/v1/session without application session
            Security->>SessionApi: Dispatch anonymous request
            SessionApi-->>Browser: 200 {authenticated:false} + Cache-Control:no-store
        end
    end
